A Real Instance</h2></div><div class="rule"></div></div><div class="lx-step" data-substep="learn"><div class="lx-g2"><div class="lx-card lx-learn"><div class="lx-learn-top"><div><span class="lx-tag">Learn</span></div><p class="lx-prose">An <strong>object</strong> is an instance of a class: a real entity stamped out from the blueprint. Calling the class like a function creates one. <code>__init__</code> runs automatically and sets the object up.</p><div class="lx-facts"><div class="lx-fact"><small>Create</small><b>Student(&quot;Juan&quot;)</b></div><div class="lx-fact"><small>Many allowed</small><b>juan, maria, alex</b></div><div class="lx-fact"><small>Each is</small><b>independent</b></div></div><div class="lx-ana"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/></svg><p>Juan, Maria and Alex are three different BSIT students, all built from the same Student blueprint.</p></div></div><div class="lx-learn-ex"><small>Example</small><pre class="lx-code"><span class="k">class</span> Student:
