: What an Object Knows</h2></div><div class="rule"></div></div><div class="lx-step" data-substep="learn"><div class="lx-g2"><div class="lx-card lx-learn"><div class="lx-learn-top"><div><span class="lx-tag">Learn</span></div><p class="lx-prose"><strong>Properties</strong> (also called attributes) are variables that store information about an object, such as <code>name</code>, <code>age</code> or <code>gender</code>. Inside a class, attach them to <code>self</code>.</p><div class="lx-facts"><div class="lx-fact"><small>Syntax</small><b>self.age = age</b></div><div class="lx-fact"><small>Read</small><b>juan.age</b></div><div class="lx-fact"><small>Also called</small><b>attribute</b></div></div><div class="lx-ana"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/></svg><p>A student ID card: name, age, course. These are the details the object carries around.</p></div></div><div class="lx-learn-ex"><small>Example</small><pre class="lx-code"><span class="k">class</span> Student:
    <span class="k">def</span> __init__(<span class="sf">self</span>, name, age):
